  "headline": "FDA's records show bumetanide injection shortage first posted 2017-12-13 and now resolved; current inventory at Corvale East is 1.4 days for 4 mL vials and 5.7 days for 10 mL vials",
  "headline_cites": ["D9", "D1", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage history shows bumetanide injection was first posted on 2017-12-13 and is now resolved as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial posting involved MSN Laboratories Private Limited, and additional resolved listings include Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Mullan Pharmaceutical Inc., and Sagent Pharmaceuticals.",
      "cites": ["E29", "E24", "E25", "E27", "E28"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 927215 at Zydus Lifesciences Limited ended 2015-05-23 classified VAI, 935 days before the 2017-12-13 posting.",
      "cites": ["D7", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1106822 at Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. ended 2019-09-10 classified VAI, 636 days after the 2017-12-13 posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zydus Lifesciences Limited received a Warning Letter on 2026-06-02.",
      "cites": ["E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 1.4 days of 4 mL vials and 5.7 days of 10 mL vials; Corvale General holds 9 days of 4 mL vials and 13.1 days of 10 mL vials.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3", "D2", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Advagen Pharma Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    }
  ]
}
